# Where to deliver local builds. Copy to telegram.env and fill in the values.
# telegram.env is in .gitignore — the token never reaches the repository.
#
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN — bot token from @BotFather.
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID    — chat id (direct chat — positive, group — -100…).
#   To find it: message the bot, open
#   https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates and take result[].message.chat.id
